question:
Find the area of the region in the coordinate plane that satisfies the system of inequalities:
\[
\begin{cases}
|x| + |y| \leq 4 \\
x^2 + y^2 \leq 16
\end{cases}

Find all integer solutions \( (a, b) \) for the system of congruences:
\[
\begin{cases}
a \equiv 3 \pmod{5} \\
b \equiv 4 \pmod{5}
\end{cases}
\]

Find the number of integers \( n \) such that the system
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
|2x-n| + n = 17 \\
|3x + 2n + 5| - n = 6
\end{array}
\right.
\]
has at least two distinct solutions for \( x \).
